%% Reporting and settlement sequence — Sokoto Rainfall Cover
sequenceDiagram
    participant REL as Oracle relayer
    participant SRC as CHIRPS / NASA POWER / Meteostat
    participant AGG as OracleAggregator
    participant KEEP as Settlement keeper
    participant INS as WeatherIndexInsurance
    participant NTF as Notifier
    loop each dekad (after it ends, full coverage)
        REL->>SRC: fetch daily rainfall for the insured point
        REL->>AGG: submitReading(period, mm×100) — one per source
        AGG-->>AGG: finalizePeriod with reputation weights
    end
    Note over INS: window's dekads all finalized
    KEEP->>INS: checkAndSettle(policyId)
    INS->>INS: compare windowRainfall vs threshold
    alt rainfall below threshold
        INS-->>INS: payout pushed to policy holder (PayoutTriggered)
    else
        INS-->>INS: PayoutSkipped
    end
    INS->>NTF: events
    NTF-->>NTF: in-app + SMS + Telegram
